                      (            os9.d):00010         * ------------------------------------------------------------------ 
                      (            os9.d):00011         *          1983/03/01
                      (            os9.d):00012         * Six new Status codes added: SS.BlkRd - SS.ELog.
                      (            os9.d):00013         *
