                      (            os9.d):00021         * F$CMDir service request added for NCM.
                      (            os9.d):00022         *
                      (            os9.d):00023         *          1983/06/29
                      (            os9.d):00024         * Added ProfFlag to init module offsets.
                      (            os9.d):00025         *
