                      (            os9.d):00027         * Added SS.Atlas for CoCo.
                      (            os9.d):00028         *
                      (            os9.d):00029         *          1983/10/08  Robert E. Sorensen
                      (            os9.d):00030         * Added SS.Break for ACIA Break command.
                      (            os9.d):00031         *
                      (            os9.d):00032         *          1983/11/29
                      (            os9.d):00033         * Added SS.RsBit to reserve (not allocate in) bitmap sector.
                      (            os9.d):00034         *
                      (            os9.d):00035         *          1984/02/17
                      (            os9.d):00036         * Added reserved status codes for Hoshi and Gimix.
                      (            os9.d):00037         *
                      (            os9.d):00038         *          1984/03/07  Mark G. Hawkins
                      (            os9.d):00039         * Added SS.Cursr and SS.ScSiz for CoCo.
                      (            os9.d):00040         * Added New signal code S$Window ... CoCo future.
                      (            os9.d):00041         *
                      (            os9.d):00042         *          1984/04/11  Mark G. Hawkins
                      (            os9.d):00043         * Added SS.Sound for CoCo.
                      (            os9.d):00044         *
                      (            os9.d):00045         *          1984/05/05  Mark G. Hawkins
                      (            os9.d):00046         * Added label SS.SetMF to Gimix Reserved byte
                      (            os9.d):00047         * Changed SS.Sound to SS.KySns.
                      (            os9.d):00048         *
                      (            os9.d):00049         *          1985/05/24  Mark G. Hawkins
                      (            os9.d):00050         * Added SS.ComSt Communication Set (Parity,Baud).
                      (            os9.d):00051         *
                      (            os9.d):00052         *          1985/05/28  Tim A. Harris
                      (            os9.d):00053         * Added F$VIRQ for Virtual IRQ.
                      (            os9.d):00054         *
                      (            os9.d):00055         *          1985/07/30  Mark G. Hawkins
                      (            os9.d):00056         * Added SS.Open, SS.Close, SS.HngUP.
                      (            os9.d):00057         *
                      (            os9.d):00058         *          1985/07/30  Mark G. Hawkins
                      (            os9.d):00059         * Added E$HangUp error for CDC Lost.
                      (            os9.d):00060         *
                      (            os9.d):00061         *          1985/08/24  Doug J. Nicholson
                      (            os9.d):00062         * Added DT.NFM device type.
                      (            os9.d):00063         *
                      (            os9.d):00064         *          1985/06/20  Mark G. Hawkins
                      (            os9.d):00065         * Added SS.MAGBf, SS.SLCBf.
                      (            os9.d):00066         *
                      (            os9.d):00067         *          1985/08/29  Ken Mizuno
                      (            os9.d):00068         * Fixed DT.SBF/NFM values to 3/4.
                      (            os9.d):00069         *
                      (            os9.d):00070         *          1985/09/01  Ken Mizuno
                      (            os9.d):00071         * Added SS.FDInf, SS.Attr to accept 68K request thru NET.
                      (            os9.d):00072         *
                      (            os9.d):00073         *          1985/09/03  Ken Mizuno/Robert F. Doggett
