0080                  (            os9.d):00289         I$Attach            RMB       1                   Attach I/O Device
0081                  (            os9.d):00290         I$Detach            RMB       1                   Detach I/O Device
0082                  (            os9.d):00291         I$Dup               RMB       1                   Duplicate Path
0083                  (            os9.d):00292         I$Create            RMB       1                   Create New File
0084                  (            os9.d):00293         I$Open              RMB       1                   Open Existing File
0085                  (            os9.d):00294         I$MakDir            RMB       1                   Make Directory File
0086                  (            os9.d):00295         I$ChgDir            RMB       1                   Change Default Directory
0087                  (            os9.d):00296         I$Delete            RMB       1                   Delete File
0088                  (            os9.d):00297         I$Seek              RMB       1                   Change Current Position
0089                  (            os9.d):00298         I$Read              RMB       1                   Read Data
008A                  (            os9.d):00299         I$Write             RMB       1                   Write Data
008B                  (            os9.d):00300         I$ReadLn            RMB       1                   Read Line of ASCII Data
008C                  (            os9.d):00301         I$WritLn            RMB       1                   Write Line of ASCII Data
