008E                  (            os9.d):00303         I$SetStt            RMB       1                   Set Path Status
008F                  (            os9.d):00304         I$Close             RMB       1                   Close Path
0090                  (            os9.d):00305         I$DeletX            RMB       1                   Delete from current exec dir
0091                  (            os9.d):00306         I$ModDsc            RMB       1                   Modify SCF/RBF Descriptor in Memory
